WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:05.273
"Detective Smith!" Roxy cried. "What's wrong with you?"

2
00:00:05.274 --> 00:00:10.926
The detective's eyes were blank. "I look fabulous!"

3
00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:14.228
Roxy ripped the ugly scarf off the detective.

4
00:00:14.229 --> 00:00:17.121
Detective Smith's eyes returned to normal.

5
00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:20.435
"Wh-what happened to me?"

6
00:00:20.436 --> 00:00:24.988
"That scarf was controlling you," the woman said.

7
00:00:24.989 --> 00:00:29.336
"Really?" Detective Smith scratched his head.

8
00:00:29.337 --> 00:00:33.376
"There's something wrong with Viktor's clothes," Roxy said.

9
00:00:33.377 --> 00:00:36.730
"They're controlling mannequins and people.

10
00:00:36.731 --> 00:00:38.797
We need to find Viktor."

11
00:00:38.798 --> 00:00:40.255
She turned to the woman.

12
00:00:40.256 --> 00:00:41.999
"Do you know where he works?"

13
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.175
The woman nodded.

14
00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:51.389
Then she looked up the address for Roxy.

15
00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:54.567
A moment later Roxy arrived at Viktor's studio.

16
00:00:54.568 --> 00:00:57.371
Ugly clothes hung on racks.

17
00:00:57.372 --> 00:01:00.998
A man in an orange hat was drawing a design.

18
00:01:00.999 --> 00:01:04.239
A tape measure was looped around his neck.

19
00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:07.659
"Viktor Velour?" Roxy asked.

20
00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.204
"Yes, that's me." The man looked up and smiled.

21
00:01:11.205 --> 00:01:15.399
"Rocket Girl!" He ran over.

22
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.314
"I will design a fabulous costume for you!"

23
00:01:18.315 --> 00:01:20.967
Viktor measured Roxy's arms and waist.

24
00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:24.267
"What colors do you like, hmm? Do you like stripes?"

25
00:01:24.268 --> 00:01:27.757
He stepped back and rubbed his chin.

26
00:01:27.758 --> 00:01:32.062
"That cape is no good. I'll design a better one!"

27
00:01:32.063 --> 00:01:36.340
Viktor sat down and started to draw again.

28
00:01:36.341 --> 00:01:39.620
"I'm not here for a new costume," Roxy said.

29
00:01:39.621 --> 00:01:41.351
Viktor put down his pencil.

30
00:01:41.352 --> 00:01:43.647
"You're not?" He blinked.

31
00:01:43.648 --> 00:01:46.155
"Then why are you here?"

32
00:01:46.156 --> 00:01:52.851
Roxy sighed. "Your clothes are controlling people—and mannequins."

33
00:01:52.852 --> 00:01:56.721
Viktor nodded. "Yes, yes. My clothes are supposed to do that.

34
00:01:56.722 --> 00:01:59.861
I was tired of people laughing at my clothes.

35
00:01:59.862 --> 00:02:01.916
Fashion models said they were ugly.

36
00:02:01.917 --> 00:02:05.555
Now my clothes are made with a special fabric that I created.

37
00:02:05.556 --> 00:02:09.161
The fabric controls people and mannequins."

38
00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:12.771
He tilted his head. "Is that a problem?"

39
00:02:12.772 --> 00:02:15.582
"Are you serious?" Roxy asked.

40
00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:20.466
"The mannequins are trying to force everyone to wear your clothes!"

41
00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:24.872
"Everyone should wear my clothes!" Viktor stood up.

42
00:02:24.873 --> 00:02:28.459
"In fact, I'm going to the big fashion show this afternoon.

43
00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.724
I'll make everyone wear my clothes.

44
00:02:30.725 --> 00:02:34.194
Then I'll be the most famous fashion designer ever!"

45
00:02:34.195 --> 00:02:37.742
"I won't let you do that," Roxy said.

46
00:02:37.743 --> 00:02:39.975
Viktor glared at Roxy.

47
00:02:39.976 --> 00:02:43.558
"Mannequins!" he shouted.

48
00:02:43.559 --> 00:02:46.099
Three mannequins rushed into the room.

49
00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:50.754
"Attack Rocket Girl!" Viktor shouted.

50
00:02:50.755 --> 00:02:54.600
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

51
00:02:54.601 --> 00:02:57.235
One mannequin exploded.

52
00:02:57.236 --> 00:02:59.807
Two other mannequins grabbed Roxy.

53
00:02:59.808 --> 00:03:03.576
"Grr!" Roxy shook off the mannequins.

54
00:03:03.577 --> 00:03:05.031
One hit the wall.

55
00:03:05.032 --> 00:03:07.965
The other one knocked down a large roll of fabric.

56
00:03:07.966 --> 00:03:11.427
The fabric quickly unrolled, spilling over Roxy.

57
00:03:11.428 --> 00:03:12.979
Her eyes went blank.

58
00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:20.512
She began to feel strange.

